<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80297" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεζο-μᾰχέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fight by land</i> or <i>on foot</i>, perh. to be
			restored in <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				5.20
			</span></i> ; of one whose horse is killed, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.69.2
			</span></i> ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυμαχέω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.45
			</span></i> ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιορκέω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				685
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τισι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.112
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ ναυμαχοῦντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					7.75
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀπὸ τῶν νεῶν</span>
			<i>fight like soldiers</i> from shipboard, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.62
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τῶν νεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.16
				</span></i>
			 ; of infantry, opp. cavalry, <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>.</div>
